---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Britain's Largest Bhangra School
description: Leicester Bhangra Classes, Britain's largest Bhangra school. Weekly classes in 8 cities across England, workshops for schools, businesses and care homes, and performances for every occasion.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Est. 15 July 2015 · 8 cities</span>
      <h1 class="h-hero">Britain's largest <span class="hl">Bhangra</span> school</h1>
      <p class="lead">Building Confidence. Creating Community. Celebrating Culture.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/signup/#classes" class="btn btn--yellow">Join a Class</a>
        <a href="/workshops/" class="btn btn--ghost-light">Book a Workshop</a>
        <a href="/locations/" class="btn btn--ghost-light">View Locations</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media"><div class="ph ph--tall" role="img" aria-label="Photo placeholder">Photo: Students mid-routine, high energy, yellow LBC tees</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--yellow section--tight">
  <div class="container stats">
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__value">8</span><span class="stat__label">Locations across England</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__value">1,000+</span><span class="stat__label">Students every month</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__value">£90k</span><span class="stat__label">Raised for charities (up to)</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__value">Monthly</span><span class="stat__label">Charity classes</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="section__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
      <h2>From one hobby to a movement</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Founded on 15th July 2015 by Aman Singh, Leicester Bhangra Classes has grown from a single hobby into a movement spanning 8 cities across England.</p>
        <p>With over <b>1,000 students attending with us every month</b>, we are proud to be the largest Bhangra school in England, and still grounded in community values.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ph ph--light ph--tall" role="img" aria-label="Photo placeholder">Photo: Founder Aman Singh teaching a class</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container section__inner">
    <div class="section__head"><span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span><h2>Three things we live by</h2></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card card--dark"><span class="card__num">01</span><h3>Confidence</h3><p>We empower shy beginners to become confident performers and leaders.</p></div>
      <div class="card card--dark"><span class="card__num">02</span><h3>Community</h3><p>We are one family, welcoming all ages and all backgrounds.</p></div>
      <div class="card card--dark"><span class="card__num">03</span><h3>Culture</h3><p>We celebrate South Asian heritage while reflecting modern Britain's diversity.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container grid grid--wide">
    <div class="card card--cream">
      <span class="eyebrow">What you'll experience</span>
      <h3>Every class, every week</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>High-energy Bhangra sessions</li>
        <li>Fitness &amp; calorie burn</li>
        <li>Stress relief &amp; mental wellbeing</li>
        <li>Performance opportunities</li>
        <li>Lifelong friendships</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card card--cream">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our impact</span>
      <h3>More than a dance class</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>8 locations across England</li>
        <li>1,000+ students monthly</li>
        <li>Up to £90,000 raised for charities</li>
        <li>Monthly charity classes</li>
        <li>Annual hikes, quiz nights &amp; community events</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container section__inner">
    <div class="section__head section__head--split">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Our services</span><h2>Bhangra for every occasion</h2></div>
      <a href="/workshops/" class="btn btn--black">Explore Our Services</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--narrow">
      {% set arrow %}<svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>{% endset %}
      {% for s in [
        ["Weekly Community Classes", "/signup/#classes"],
        ["School Workshops", "/workshops/#school"],
        ["Corporate Workshops", "/workshops/#corporate"],
        ["Care Home Workshops", "/workshops/#care-home"],
        ["Weddings & Performances", "/book-us/"],
        ["International Shows", "/book-us/"],
        ["One-to-One Training", "/signup/#one-to-one"]
      ] %}
      <a class="card link-card" href="{{ s[1] }}"><span class="link-card__title">{{ s[0] }}</span><span class="link-card__more">Find out more {{ arrow | safe }}</span></a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container cta-band__inner">
    <h2>Ready to dance?</h2>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/signup/#classes" class="btn btn--black">Join a Class</a>
      <a href="/book-us/" class="btn">Book Us for an Event</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
